// OKX Signal Bot — AVAX Vegas 通道 (EMA144/169) 突破策略
// 目標: TradingView alert → OKX 信號 bot 自動下單
// 策略: 滿倉 stop-and-reverse. 突破隧道上沿做多, 跌破下沿反手做空
// 回測(AVAX 4h 2022-2026): 月化~3.6% 回撤~-19% 勝率23%
// 用法: 貼 Pine Editor → Add to chart (AVAX 4h) → 設 Alert 選此策略
//       Alert Msg 用 OKX 官方 JSON 格式 (見 OKX help 頁面)
// 2026-08-14 更新: 資金利用率調降 default_qty_value 30%→10% (一帳戶可多跑幾個策略)

//@version=6
strategy("OKX AVAX Vegas 通道", shorttitle="AVAXVegas", overlay=true,
     initial_capital=150, default_qty_type=strategy.percent_of_equity,
     default_qty_value=10, pyramiding=0, commission_type=strategy.commission.percent,
     commission_value=0.05)

tunA = input.int(144, "快隧道 EMA")
tunB = input.int(169, "慢隧道 EMA")

emaA = ta.ema(close, tunA)
emaB = ta.ema(close, tunB)
tunTop = math.max(emaA, emaB)
tunBot = math.min(emaA, emaB)

// 突破訊號
longSig = close > tunTop
shortSig = close < tunBot

// 滿倉 stop-and-reverse: strategy.entry 反向時 TV 自動先平原倉
if longSig
    strategy.entry("Long", strategy.long)
if shortSig
    strategy.entry("Short", strategy.short)

// 視覺
up = plot(tunTop, "上", color=color.new(color.teal, 30), linewidth=2)
dn = plot(tunBot, "下", color=color.new(color.teal, 30), linewidth=2)
fill(up, dn, color=color.new(color.teal, 92))
plotshape(longSig, "多", style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.green, size=size.small)
plotshape(shortSig, "空", style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.red, size=size.small)
